,"SearchSource":{"AllowFreeResponse":"false"},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"In your own words, and in as much detail as possible, please explain your reasoning for this prediction.<i><\/i>","DataExportTag":"Q141","QuestionID":"QID141"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_byBblheEaWmuniu","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID142","SecondaryAttribute":"Step 5: After seeing the explanation, do you think the AV slowed down mainly because of the stop...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<b><i>Step 5:<\/i><\/b><br>\nAfter seeing the explanation, do you think the AV slowed down mainly because of the stop sign and road bump?","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Step 5: After seeing the explanation, do you think the AV slowed down mainly because of the stop...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Yes"},"2":{"Display":"No"}},"ChoiceOrder":[1,2],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":3,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<b><i>Step 6:<\/i><\/b><br>\nAfter seeing the explanation, if the AV was slightly to the left, do you think it still would have kept moving forwards?","DataExportTag":"Q142","QuestionID":"QID142"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_byBblheEaWmuniu","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID143","SecondaryAttribute":"Now provide a confidence rating for this prediction.","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Now provide a confidence rating for this prediction.","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"Matrix","Selector":"Likert","SubSelector":"SingleAnswer","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","TextPosition":"inline","ChoiceColumnWidth":25,"RepeatHeaders":"none","WhiteSpace":"OFF","MobileFirst":true},"QuestionDescription":"Now provide a confidence rating for this prediction.","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"How confident are you in this prediction?"}},"ChoiceOrder":[1],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":2,"NextAnswerId":8,"Answers":{"1":{"Display":"Not confident at all"},"2":{"Display":"&nbsp;"},"3":{"Display":"&nbsp;"},"4":{"Display":"Neutral"},"5":{"Display":"&nbsp;"},"6":{"Display":"&nbsp;"},"7":{"Display":"Extremely confident"}},"AnswerOrder":[1,2,3,4,5,6,7],"ChoiceDataExportTags":false,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"Now provide a confidence rating for this prediction.","DataExportTag":"Q143","QuestionID":"QID143"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_byBblheEaWmuniu","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID144","SecondaryAttribute":"In your own words, and in as much detail as possible, please explain your reasoning for this pred...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"In your own words, and in as much detail as possible, please explain your reasoning for this prediction.<i><\/i>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"TE","Selector":"ESTB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"In your own words, and in as much detail as possible, please explain your reasoning for this pred...","Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"SearchSource":{"AllowFreeResponse":"false"},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"In your own words, and in as much detail as possible, please explain your reasoning for this prediction.<i><\/i>","DataExportTag":"Q144","QuestionID":"QID144"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_byBblheEaWmuniu","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID145","SecondaryAttribute":"Instructions for interpreting explanations \u00a0 When you see the video a second time it will contain..","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<h1>Instructions for interpreting explanations<\/h1>\n&nbsp;\n\n<p>When you see the video a second time it will contain&nbsp;<b data-stringify-type=\"bold\">real-time explanations<\/b>&nbsp;of the AV behavior. Specifically, you will see&nbsp;<b data-stringify-type=\"bold\">concepts<\/b>&nbsp;that it is detecting:<\/p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>If a concept <b>is currently detected<\/b>, you will see it&nbsp;<u><b data-stringify-type=\"bold\">highlighted in green<\/b><\/u>.<\/li>\n\t<li>If a concept <b>is&nbsp;<span data-stringify-type=\"bold\">NOT<\/span>&nbsp;currently detected<\/b>, it will be <b><u>gray in color<\/u><\/b>.<\/li>\n\t<li>You will only see the&nbsp;<strong>two most relevant concepts per video<\/strong>.<\/li>\n\t<li data-stringify-indent=\"0\" data-stringify-border=\"0\">The concepts may turn green or gray at anytime during the video.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<br>\n<span style=\"color:#e74c3c;\"><b>Important<\/b>: It is possible a concept may never activate.<\/span><br>\n<br>\n<em><strong>For Example see this image below<\/strong><\/em><br>\n<img src=\"https:\/\/mit.co1.qualtrics.com\/CP\/Graphic.php?IM=IM_1G36xgJIOSHUUwS\"><br>\n&nbsp;","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Instructions for interpreting explanations \u00a0 When you see the video a second time it will contain...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":9,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<h1>Instructions<\/h1>\n<br>\nYou will be shown 6 scenarios from a Motional self-driving car being tested (along with 1 practice question).<br>\n<br>\nThe videos will be from the point of view of the safety driver.&nbsp;<br>\n&nbsp;&nbsp;\n<h2><i>You task is to:<\/i><\/h2>\n<b>Step 1:<\/b> Carefully view the video and imagine yourself in the driver's position.<br>\n<b>Step 2:<\/b>&nbsp;Answer a question about why the AV drove the way it did, give a confidence score, and a free-from text rationale for your choice.<br><b>Step 3: <\/b>Answer a question about what the AV would do in an imagined situation, give a confidence score, and a free-from text rationale for your choice.\n<br><br>\n-- click to next page --<br>\n<br>\n<b>Step 4:<\/b> View the same video, but this time with an explanation of what concepts the AV is detecting.<br>\n<b>Step 5: <\/b>In light of the explanation, once more, repeat <b>Step 2's<\/b> questions.<br><b>Step 6: <\/b>In light of the explanation, once more, repeat <b>Step 3's<\/b> questions.\n<br><br>\nThe video quality is not always great, but please try your best. Some videos are in 2x speed.","DataExportTag":"Q145","QuestionID":"QID145"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_byBblheEaWmuniu","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID146","SecondaryAttribute":"Final (important) Instructions Each scenario you see is with a different automated vehicle (AV),...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<h1>Final (important) Instructions<\/h1>\n<br>\nEach scenario you see is with a <b>different automated vehicle (AV)<\/b>, you should consider them all separately and&nbsp;<i><b>DO NOT conflate the ability of one AV to the next AV<\/b>.&nbsp;<\/i><br>\n<br>\nFor example, if you think one video demonstrates the AV is very good (or bad) at detecting a certain concept, you should not assume the AV in the next video is the same.<br>\n<br>\nAgain, this is an <em><u><strong>experimental Motional AV,<\/strong><\/u><\/em>&nbsp;do not have expectations of its abilities, it may correctly or incorrectly detect concepts at any time.<ul>\n<\/ul>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q146","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Final (important) Instructions Each scenario you see is with a different automated vehicle (AV),...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"